    <item>
      <title>Debugging on OSX</title>
      <link>/core/c&#43;&#43;/debug/osx-debug/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 10 Sep 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/core/c&#43;&#43;/debug/osx-debug/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;sip-system-integrity-protection&#34;&gt;SIP (System Integrity Protection)&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;SIP is introduced in OS X EI Capitan.&#xA;Turn it off to debug an app. &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.imore.com/how-turn-system-integrity-protection-macos&#34;&gt;Turn off SIP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Note:&#xA;On some old version of OSX (e.g. 10.9) extra command is required:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;$ sudo /usr/sbin/DevToolsSecurity --enable&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Password:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Developer mode is now enabled.&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
    </item>
